</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I only live for You—</l><l>Not anything else!</l><l>In everything You’re my source;</l><l>No more good intentions,</l><l>No more right or wrong.</l><l>I don’t want a “good” life—</l><l>I want You!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
